{"id":"d3c982f03a066db1","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-turing-machine-computation.md","title":"Configurations and Numerical Turing Computations","display":"df-turing-machine-computation — Configurations and Numerical Turing Computations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-turing-machine-computation","aliases":["68-df-turing-machine-computation"],"display":"df-turing-machine-computation — Configurations and Numerical Turing Computations","depends_on":["[[68-df-turing-machine]]","[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]"],"source_location":"Local reconstruction of missing interfaces from the supplied 68 archive; original external text unavailable","verification_status":"local-formalization-reviewed","source_proof_status":"not-proof-assistant-checked","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-turing-machine-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-turing-machine-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine-computation — Configurations and Numerical Turing Computations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e88d3edb906e9454\" href=\"?note=e88d3edb906e9454\" title=\"68-df-turing-machine\">68-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local reconstruction of missing interfaces from the supplied 68 archive; original external text unavailable"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\in\\mathscr M_{68}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\in\\mathscr M_{68}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma\">\\(\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma\\)</span>。机器集合见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e88d3edb906e9454\" href=\"?note=e88d3edb906e9454\" title=\"68-df-turing-machine\">68-df-turing-machine</a>；有限序列连接与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_k\">\\(\\mathcal F_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,q&#39;\\in Q\">\\(q,q&#39;\\in Q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,z\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h,z\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\Gamma\">\\(c\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}\">\\(d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,t,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,t,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\{1,2\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(w\\in\\{1,2\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b)\\)</span> 是纸带，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_M\">\\(\\Delta_M\\)</span> 的定义域和值域均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cfg}_{68}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cfg}_{68}(M)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,\\cdot)\">\\(C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,\\cdot)\\)</span> 是配置序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{In}_{68}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{1,2\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{In}_{68}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{1,2\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Out}_{68}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{Out}_{68}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}\">\\(F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}\\)</span> 是数值偏函数图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}:=\\{M\\in\\mathscr M_{68}:\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b\\;(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\land\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}:=\\{M\\in\\mathscr M_{68}:\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b\\;(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\land\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b):=\\{\\theta\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:\\theta(z)\\ne b\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Cfg}_{68}(M):=Q\\times\\mathbb Z\\times\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b):=\\{\\theta\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:\\theta(z)\\ne b\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Cfg}_{68}(M):=Q\\times\\mathbb Z\\times\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta[h\\mapsto c]:=(\\theta\\restriction(\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{h\\}))\\cup\\{(h,c)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta[h\\mapsto c]:=(\\theta\\restriction(\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{h\\}))\\cup\\{(h,c)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_M(q,h,\\theta):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,h,\\theta)&amp;q\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\},\\\\\n(q&#39;,h+d,\\theta[h\\mapsto c])&amp;q\\notin\\{q_a,q_r\\}\\land\\delta(q,\\theta(h))=(q&#39;,c,d).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_M(q,h,\\theta):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,h,\\theta)&amp;q\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\},\\\\\n(q&#39;,h+d,\\theta[h\\mapsto c])&amp;q\\notin\\{q_a,q_r\\}\\land\\delta(q,\\theta(h))=(q&#39;,c,d).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Out}_{68}(y):=\\{(i,1):i&lt;y\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{In}_{68}(()):=().\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Out}_{68}(y):=\\{(i,1):i&lt;y\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{In}_{68}(()):=().\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{In}_{68}(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle):=\\operatorname{In}_{68}(\\vec x)\\,^{\\frown}\\operatorname{Out}_{68}(y)\\,^{\\frown}\\langle2\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{In}_{68}(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle):=\\operatorname{In}_{68}(\\vec x)\\,^{\\frown}\\operatorname{Out}_{68}(y)\\,^{\\frown}\\langle2\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tape}_{b}(w)(z):=\\begin{cases}w(z)&amp;0\\le z&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(w),\\\\b&amp;z&lt;0\\lor z\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(w).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tape}_{b}(w)(z):=\\begin{cases}w(z)&amp;0\\le z&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(w),\\\\b&amp;z&lt;0\\lor z\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(w).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,0):=(q_0,0,\\operatorname{tape}_{b}(\\operatorname{In}_{68}(\\vec x))),\\qquad C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,t+1):=\\Delta_M(C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,0):=(q_0,0,\\operatorname{tape}_{b}(\\operatorname{In}_{68}(\\vec x))),\\qquad C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,t+1):=\\Delta_M(C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TMVal}_{68}(M,k,\\vec x,y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,t)=(q_a,0,\\operatorname{tape}_{b}(\\operatorname{Out}_{68}(y))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TMVal}_{68}(M,k,\\vec x,y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,t)=(q_a,0,\\operatorname{tape}_{b}(\\operatorname{Out}_{68}(y))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{TMVal}_{68}(M,k,\\vec x,y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{TMVal}_{68}(M,k,\\vec x,y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}\\in\\mathcal F_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}\\in\\mathcal F_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输入用一元块与分隔符 2 编码，每个输入数之后都有分隔符；零元输入为空词，数值 0 的输出为空词。纸带用整数位置上的有限非空白支撑函数表示；初始头位置固定为 0。只把成功终态、头位置 0 且整条纸带恰为规定输出的配置作为有定义结果；拒绝、无限运行及不合输出规范的终态均不产生函数值。终态吸收性、转移确定性和输出编码单射性共同保证图是单值的。全部约定均在前两节给出，不需要第 88 本、外部输入码或口头停机约定。此接口是缺失依赖所必需的本地补全，不包含额外计算能力假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e88d3edb906e9454","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e88d3edb906e9454","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\in\\mathscr M_{68}$，且 $\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma$。机器集合见 [[68-df-turing-machine]]；有限序列连接与 $\\mathcal F_k$ 见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$q,q'\\in Q$，$h,z\\in\\mathbb Z$，$c\\in\\Gamma$，$d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}$，$k,t,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$，$w\\in\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}$。$\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b)$ 是纸带，$\\Delta_M$ 的定义域和值域均为 $\\operatorname{Cfg}_{68}(M)$；$C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,\\cdot)$ 是配置序列。$\\operatorname{In}_{68}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}$，$\\operatorname{Out}_{68}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}$ 是数值偏函数图。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\in\\mathscr M_{68}$，且 $\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma$。机器集合见 [[68-df-turing-machine]]；有限序列连接与 $\\mathcal F_k$ 见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$q,q'\\in Q$，$h,z\\in\\mathbb Z$，$c\\in\\Gamma$，$d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}$，$k,t,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$，$w\\in\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}$。$\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b)$ 是纸带，$\\Delta_M$ 的定义域和值域均为 $\\operatorname{Cfg}_{68}(M)$；$C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,\\cdot)$ 是配置序列。$\\operatorname{In}_{68}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}$，$\\operatorname{Out}_{68}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}$ 是数值偏函数图。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\in\\mathscr M_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_k","display":false},{"tex":"q,q'\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"h,z\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k,t,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cfg}_{68}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{In}_{68}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Out}_{68}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}:=\\{M\\in\\mathscr M_{68}:\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b\\;(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_a,q_r,b)\\land\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\Sigma)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b):=\\{\\theta\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:\\theta(z)\\ne b\\}|<\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Cfg}_{68}(M):=Q\\times\\mathbb Z\\times\\operatorname{Tape}_{68}(\\Gamma,b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta[h\\mapsto c]:=(\\theta\\restriction(\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{h\\}))\\cup\\{(h,c)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_M(q,h,\\theta):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,h,\\theta)&q\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\},\\\\\n(q',h+d,\\theta[h\\mapsto c])&q\\notin\\{q_a,q_r\\}\\land\\delta(q,\\theta(h))=(q',c,d).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Out}_{68}(y):=\\{(i,1):i<y\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{In}_{68}(()):=().","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{In}_{68}(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle):=\\operatorname{In}_{68}(\\vec x)\\,^{\\frown}\\operatorname{Out}_{68}(y)\\,^{\\frown}\\langle2\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tape}_{b}(w)(z):=\\begin{cases}w(z)&0\\le z<\\operatorname{lh}(w),\\\\b&z<0\\lor z\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(w).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,0):=(q_0,0,\\operatorname{tape}_{b}(\\operatorname{In}_{68}(\\vec x))),\\qquad C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,t+1):=\\Delta_M(C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,t)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TMVal}_{68}(M,k,\\vec x,y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;C^{\\mathrm{TM}}(M,k,\\vec x,t)=(q_a,0,\\operatorname{tape}_{b}(\\operatorname{Out}_{68}(y))).","display":true},{"tex":"F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{TMVal}_{68}(M,k,\\vec x,y)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}\\in\\mathcal F_k.","display":true}],"bytes":3634,"backlinks":[{"id":"a401bb5f3984f9c5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathcal F_k$。$\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}$、$F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}$、$\\mathcal F_k$ 及其固定输入/输出规则见 [[68-df-turing-machine-computation]] 及其上游。$\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)$ 为带元数的可计算性谓词；$\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}$ 为第 $k$ 元类，$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 保留原目录的全元数接口。"},{"id":"fd495d9c69fc281b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 是 [[68-df-turing-computable-function]] 的本地图灵机偏函数类，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]。图灵机的机器集合、输入编码、配置演化和输出规则全部取 [[68-df-turing-machine-computation]] 的固定定义。基本机器与偏递归函数类的对应见 [[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-machine-computation]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-machine-computation]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"图灵机、运行和可计算函数的定义已经存在于本次附件中，分别见 [[68-df-turing-machine]]、[[68-df-turing-machine-computation]]、[[68-df-turing-computable-function]]。本轮逐一解析原包文件目标与历史别名，未发现显式悬空文件链接，不将原包关于先前缺失第 88 本正文的历史说明误当作当前数学前提。原包此前已将旧 Church–Turing 条目中的过时外部证明要求改为 [[68-thm-turing-recursive-equivalence]] 的本地依赖；保留的等式入口为 [[68-cor-turing-recursive-class-equality]]。"}],"outgoing":["e88d3edb906e9454","c524671590651be2"]}